      "sha": "577981805caa85d4768745bfc1e2a01a619ad81a",
      "message": "fix: resolve budget.toml from workspace root instead of cwd\n\nWalking up from the current directory to the workspace root ensures\ncargo cost-lint produces identical lint levels regardless of which\nmember crate it is invoked from.\n\n- Add find_workspace_root_from() walking up looking for [workspace]\n- Change --config to Option<String> (default: None) to distinguish\n  explicit from absent\n- Print 'Using config: <path>' when a config is loaded\n- Document the lookup rule in docs/integration.md\n- Add unit tests for workspace resolution, explicit paths, member dirs",
      "isVerified": false,
      "authoredAt": "2026-07-24T08:13:36Z"
    },
